<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/13/eng@/~cl_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/13/eng@> .
